{"id":"888d8ab66ec7efca","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-dtm-language-semantics.md","title":"Input, Acceptance, and Language of a Turing Machine","display":"df-turing-machine-language — Input, Acceptance, and Language of a Turing Machine","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-dtm-language-semantics","aliases":["73-df-dtm-language-semantics","73-df-turing-machine-language"],"display":"df-turing-machine-language — Input, Acceptance, and Language of a Turing Machine","depends_on":["[[73-df-dtm-finite-support-configurations]]","[[73-df-dtm-finite-runs]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-dtm-language-semantics"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-dtm-language-semantics</span><span>73-df-turing-machine-language</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-turing-machine-language — Input, Acceptance, and Language of a Turing Machine"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8dd5a913cb2152a3\" href=\"?note=8dd5a913cb2152a3\" title=\"73-df-dtm-finite-support-configurations\">73-df-dtm-finite-support-configurations</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8630ed136c8dde2d\" href=\"?note=8630ed136c8dde2d\" title=\"73-df-dtm-finite-runs\">73-df-dtm-finite-runs</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}})\\in\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}})\\in\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span> (single-tape DTM)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Conf}_M\">\\(\\operatorname{Conf}_M\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to_M^*\">\\(\\to_M^*\\)</span> (configurations and finite runs, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8630ed136c8dde2d\" href=\"?note=8630ed136c8dde2d\" title=\"73-df-dtm-finite-runs\">73-df-dtm-finite-runs</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in\\Sigma^*\">\\(w\\in\\Sigma^*\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\mathbb Z\">\\(i\\in\\mathbb Z\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_w\">\\(T_w\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_M^{\\mathsf{init}}\">\\(C_M^{\\mathsf{init}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Accept}_M\">\\(\\operatorname{Accept}_M\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Reject}_M\">\\(\\operatorname{Reject}_M\\)</span> 的输入词域均为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^*\">\\(\\Sigma^*\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine\\text{-}language}\\vdash\nT_w(i)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\nw(i),&amp;0\\leq i&lt;|w|,\\\\\n\\mathrm{blank},&amp;i&lt;0\\lor |w|\\le i,\n\\end{cases}\n\\qquad\nC_M^{\\mathsf{init}}(w)\\coloneqq(q_0,T_w,0)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine\\text{-}language}\\vdash\nT_w(i)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\nw(i),&amp;0\\leq i&lt;|w|,\\\\\n\\mathrm{blank},&amp;i&lt;0\\lor |w|\\le i,\n\\end{cases}\n\\qquad\nC_M^{\\mathsf{init}}(w)\\coloneqq(q_0,T_w,0)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Accept}_M(w)\\leftrightarrow\nw\\in\\Sigma^*\\land\\exists C\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_M\\;\n\\bigl(C_M^{\\mathsf{init}}(w)\\to_M^*C\\land\\operatorname{Accepting}_M(C)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Accept}_M(w)\\leftrightarrow\nw\\in\\Sigma^*\\land\\exists C\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_M\\;\n\\bigl(C_M^{\\mathsf{init}}(w)\\to_M^*C\\land\\operatorname{Accepting}_M(C)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Reject}_M(w)\\leftrightarrow\nw\\in\\Sigma^*\\land\\exists C\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_M\\;\n\\bigl(C_M^{\\mathsf{init}}(w)\\to_M^*C\\land\\operatorname{Rejecting}_M(C)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Reject}_M(w)\\leftrightarrow\nw\\in\\Sigma^*\\land\\exists C\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_M\\;\n\\bigl(C_M^{\\mathsf{init}}(w)\\to_M^*C\\land\\operatorname{Rejecting}_M(C)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine\\text{-}language}\\vdash\nL(M)\\coloneqq\\{w\\in\\Sigma^*:\\operatorname{Accept}_M(w)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine\\text{-}language}\\vdash\nL(M)\\coloneqq\\{w\\in\\Sigma^*:\\operatorname{Accept}_M(w)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The input word begins at cell <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> and every other cell is blank. Determinism and distinct halting states make acceptance and rejection disjoint.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-dtm-finite-support-configurations","status":"resolved","id":"8dd5a913cb2152a3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-dtm-finite-support-configurations]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dtm-finite-runs","status":"resolved","id":"8630ed136c8dde2d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-dtm-finite-runs]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dtm-finite-runs","status":"resolved","id":"8630ed136c8dde2d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Conf}_M$ and $\\to_M^*$ (configurations and finite runs, see [[73-df-dtm-finite-runs]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}})\\in\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Conf}_M","display":false},{"tex":"\\to_M^*","display":false},{"tex":"w\\in\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in\\mathbb Z","display":false},{"tex":"T_w","display":false},{"tex":"C_M^{\\mathsf{init}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Accept}_M","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Reject}_M","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine\\text{-}language}\\vdash\nT_w(i)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\nw(i),&0\\leq i<|w|,\\\\\n\\mathrm{blank},&i<0\\lor |w|\\le i,\n\\end{cases}\n\\qquad\nC_M^{\\mathsf{init}}(w)\\coloneqq(q_0,T_w,0)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Accept}_M(w)\\leftrightarrow\nw\\in\\Sigma^*\\land\\exists C\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_M\\;\n\\bigl(C_M^{\\mathsf{init}}(w)\\to_M^*C\\land\\operatorname{Accepting}_M(C)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Reject}_M(w)\\leftrightarrow\nw\\in\\Sigma^*\\land\\exists C\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_M\\;\n\\bigl(C_M^{\\mathsf{init}}(w)\\to_M^*C\\land\\operatorname{Rejecting}_M(C)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine\\text{-}language}\\vdash\nL(M)\\coloneqq\\{w\\in\\Sigma^*:\\operatorname{Accept}_M(w)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"0","display":false}],"bytes":1891,"backlinks":[{"id":"b9e8acd6d8438a5d","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$C_M^{\\mathsf{init}},\\to_M^*,\\operatorname{Halting}_M$ (machine semantics, see [[73-df-dtm-language-semantics]] and [[73-df-dtm-finite-runs]])"},{"id":"c57f7e70a2bf0e74","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Accept}_M(w)$ (machine acceptance, see [[73-df-dtm-language-semantics]])"},{"id":"db96cabedd089e5f","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"21f2d14c4c84bf99","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$M\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}$；$L(M)$ 见 [[73-df-dtm-language-semantics]]。$L_d$ 保留原文第二个断言与条目主题的“不接受自身编码”含义。"},{"id":"004d4e2ba3fdd14e","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Accept}_M,\\operatorname{Reject}_M$ and $L(M)$ (machine semantics, see [[73-df-dtm-language-semantics]])"},{"id":"11b19b6d211be8ab","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\Sigma}$ and $L(M)$ (deterministic Turing machines and their accepted languages, see [[73-df-dtm-language-semantics]])"},{"id":"349bd461911980d1","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"219767ec839d8c84","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Halting}_M$、$\\to_M^*$ 见 [[73-df-dtm-fini